<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11908] OOM in MVCC PDS4 </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11908</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Almost every time &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_MvccPds4&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=%3Cdefault%3E&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;MVCC PDS 4&lt;/a&gt; fails with OOM. Regular &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Pds4&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=%3Cdefault%3E&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PDS 4&lt;/a&gt; fails as well. Sometimes timeout occurs instead of OOM.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13238537">IGNITE-11908</key>
            <summary>OOM in MVCC PDS4 </summary>
