                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16860037" author="pavlukhin" created="Mon, 10 Jun 2019 14:25:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It is likely the issue is caused by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10078&quot; title=&quot;Node failure during concurrent partition updates may cause partition desync between primary and backup.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10078&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10078&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16864755" author="pavlukhin" created="Sat, 15 Jun 2019 16:25:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It was observed after fixing possible checkpointer infinite hang in case of assertion failure in &lt;tt&gt;IgnitePdsCacheWalDisabledOnRebalancingTest.testRebalancedPartitionsOwningWithConcurrentAffinityChange&lt;/tt&gt; OOM does not reproduce anymore. Such effect was observed in multiple &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Pds4&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F6602%2Fhead&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TC runs&lt;/a&gt;. Merged restructuring &lt;tt&gt;testRebalancedPartitionsOwningWithConcurrentAffinityChange&lt;/tt&gt; to avoid hanging. The mentioned assertion failure shoud be investigated.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16865024" author="pavlukhin" created="Sun, 16 Jun 2019 14:18:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;OOM was stil reproducing after fixing &lt;tt&gt;IgnitePdsCacheWalDisabledOnRebalancingTest.testRebalancedPartitionsOwningWithConcurrentAffinityChange&lt;/tt&gt; in scheduled TC RunAll runs. After that it was observed in logs that &lt;tt&gt;IgnitePdsStartWIthEmptyArchive.test&lt;/tt&gt; had been the last test before OOM. It was ignored and OOM did not occur after a couple of TC runs.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17758924" author="slava.koptilin" created="Fri, 25 Aug 2023 08:34:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is not actual anymore due to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13871&quot; title=&quot;MVCC removal&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-13871&quot;&gt;IGNITE-13871&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15760&quot; title=&quot;[IEP-80] Removal of MVCC caches support&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-15760&quot;&gt;IGNITE-15760&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
